cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
title: "Extrinsic Is Not One Thing: Recipient Exchangeability in Evolutionary Systems (code and data)"
abstract: >-
  Simulation substrate, analysis pipeline, pre-registration and reproduction
  material for the manuscript "Extrinsic Is Not One Thing: Recipient
  Exchangeability in Evolutionary Systems". Includes the digital ecology in
  which both coordinates are manipulated independently, the three-arm
  reliance design, and a test suite that re-derives the manuscript's
  dominance claims from its own audit table.
